sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant Lead as Case lead
    participant Specialist as Selected specialist
    participant Tools as Scoped evidence and model tools
    participant State as Durable case state
    actor Analyst as Risk analyst
    participant KB as Reviewed knowledge
    participant Prevention as Prevention learner
    participant Gate as Local payment gate
    Customer->>Lead: Complaint with disputed transaction IDs
    Lead->>State: Freeze evidence and reserve generation
    opt Specialist evidence is useful
        Lead->>Specialist: Typed question with pinned case revision
        Specialist->>Tools: Choose a scoped query or registered model
        Tools-->>Specialist: Versioned facts or prediction receipt
        Specialist->>State: Commit cited finding and uncertainty
        State-->>Lead: Updated case revision
    end
    opt Customer evidence is missing
        Lead->>Customer: Focused follow-up question
        Customer-->>Lead: Reply resumes the same case allowance
    end
    Lead->>Analyst: Resolution proposal with evidence and open risks
    Analyst->>State: Verify and approve the case
    State->>KB: Publish approved lesson with provenance
    State->>Prevention: Reviewed case within remaining case budget
    Prevention->>Tools: Propose safeguard and replay controls
    Tools-->>Analyst: Replay result and source references
    Analyst->>State: Persist activation of the reviewed safeguard
    Customer->>Gate: Later transaction
    Gate->>State: Read the active policy version
    State-->>Gate: Approved conditions and provenance
    Gate-->>Customer: Hold for verification or allow before debit
